          "orig": "The Von Ryan's Leaper declares a charge against the Eradicators, who are on top of a terrain feature 3\" in height. The horizontal distance between the two units when the charge is declared is 4 1/2\". To end a Charge move within Engagement Range, the Tyranids player would need a Charge roll of 7 or higher.",
          "text": "The Von Ryan's Leaper declares a charge against the Eradicators, who are on top of a terrain feature 3\" in height. The horizontal distance between the two units when the charge is declared is 4 1/2\". To end a Charge move within Engagement Range, the Tyranids player would need a Charge roll of 7 or higher."
        }
